Package:        bareos-filedaemon-proxmox-qmp-python-plugin
Architecture:   any
Section:        python
Pre-Depends:    debconf (>= 1.4.30) | debconf-2.0
Depends:        bareos-common (= ${binary:Version}), bareos-filedaemon-python3-plugin (= ${binary:Version}), python3-libnbd, python3-qemu-qmp, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Backup Archiving Recovery Open Sourced - file daemon Proxmox QMP plugin
 Bareos is a set of programs to manage backup, recovery and verification of
 data across a network of computers of different kinds.
 .
 This package provides the Proxmox QMP Python plugin for the filedaemon.
 It requires python3-qemu-qmp from Debian 13 backports.
